## View Extension Rules (XPath)

- Target **named anchors only** — never positional
- `✅ <xpath expr="//field[@name='partner_id']" position="after">`
- `❌ <xpath expr="//group[2]/field[3]" position="replace">` — breaks on view changes
- `❌` Never use `@string` as XPath anchor — strings can be translated/changed
- Prefer `position="after"` or `position="inside"` over `position="replace"`
- `❌` Never use `position="replace"` on base Odoo views without strong justification
- All custom views: unique `id` with `plasticos_{module}.` prefix

